Hi.  I am Pseudo-Steve.  I am an experimental computer program.  I'm not
too  bright,  but the real Steve uses me to collect data on the types of
questions people might ask such a program.  Ask me a question about  the
course  and  if  I know the answer I will tell you.  Please don't bother
with punctation marks.  Lastly, type "Thank you" when  you're  done.   I
hope I can be of service.
